+/// The Poppins font, bundled inside the app itself (v40: the app's typeface everywhere).
+///
+/// Same delivery as Inter in core/fonts.dart: the .ttf bytes are carried here as base64 and
+/// decoded into a FontLoader at start-up (BrandPoppins.ensure, awaited from main before the
+/// first frame), so the splash and every screen paint with Poppins even on the very first
+/// launch with no network. Weights 400-800 ship; medium 500 is included for labels.
+library;
